{"text": " You attended the Satipatthana course to understand it directly in the words of Buddha. Not that in the first Satipatthana course one understands everything. As I said, every word will be clear when you reach the final goal. But it will become clearer and clearer as you practice. So many questions keep coming, I smile at the questions, they are good. After all, human being is a rational being. He wants to rationalize whatever one is doing. Yes, it is good, one should do. But questions, somebody who has passed through that process, it looks like a child's question. When people ask, the same very persons who are asking this question, practicing further, further, further, the answer will come. And the answer that will come by your own...", "segments": [{"id": 0, "seek": 0, "start": 0.0, "end": 16.48, "text": " You attended the Satipatthana course to understand it directly in the words of Buddha.", "tokens": [50364, 509, 15990, 264, 5344, 647, 267, 392, 2095, 1164, 281, 1223, 309, 3838, 294, 264, 2283, 295, 16375, 13, 51188], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.21181744542615166, "compression_ratio": 1.5170068027210883, "no_speech_prob": 0.5497796535491943}, {"id": 1, "seek": 0, "start": 16.48, "end": 20.2, "text": " Not that in the first Satipatthana course one understands everything.", "tokens": [51188, 1726, 300, 294, 264, 700, 5344, 647, 267, 392, 2095, 1164, 472, 15146, 1203, 13, 51374], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.21181744542615166, "compression_ratio": 1.5170068027210883, "no_speech_prob": 0.5497796535491943}, {"id": 2, "seek": 0, "start": 20.2, "end": 25.52, "text": " As I said, every word will be clear when you reach the final goal.", "tokens": [51374, 1018, 286, 848, 11, 633, 1349, 486, 312, 1850, 562, 291, 2524, 264, 2572, 3387, 13, 51640], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.21181744542615166, "compression_ratio": 1.5170068027210883, "no_speech_prob": 0.5497796535491943}, {"id": 3, "seek": 2552, "start": 25.52, "end": 30.12, "text": "